Row 1 (left to right):
1. One thick arc leaping up from the left and crashing down on the right, a jagged impact burst and a short ground line where it lands.
2. An armored knight lunging forward on a low diagonal with a lance leveled ahead, thick speed waves streaming behind the back.
3. A fierce eagle head in profile facing right, sharp hooked beak, one bold eye cut as a white gap.

Row 2 (left to right):
4. A ring of tall thick flames standing on the ground in a full circle, seen from a low angle.
5. A horned skull rising out of a flat ritual circle with a five-pointed star drawn in it.
6. A sword pointing straight up, a broad sunburst of thick rays behind its tip.

Row 3 (left to right):
7. A kneeling hooded figure in profile, head bowed low, one thick heavy chevron pressing down above the head.
8. Three small round orbs in a zigzag row, linked by one heavy jagged lightning bolt jumping from orb to orb.
9. One heavy zigzag lightning bolt with two thick hollow outline copies of it trailing behind on a diagonal, each copy smaller.
